different variances

00:17:27.974 --> 00:17:29.140
in the number of containers.

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:31.460
Like if you've only got two
or three different things

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.140
running, you're like,
eh, it's not too bad.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:32.640
BRAD ABRAMS: Right.

00:17:32.640 --> 00:17:33.130
You can manage that.

00:17:33.130 --> 00:17:34.490
DAVID: You get in a real
production environment,

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.870
you're talking
potentially hundreds

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:38.380
